00:02:48.660 --> 00:02:51.030
So they hire people to, yeah.

00:02:51.030 --> 00:02:53.427
Or they get people in the contest

00:02:53.427 --> 00:02:54.407
and so yeah, we did that.

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:56.280
