00:02:57.747 --> 00:02:58.580
- [Craig] Oh for sure.
- Yeah.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:02:59.787
All walks of life come.

00:02:59.787 --> 00:03:00.780
- Yeah, I was gonna say

00:03:00.780 --> 00:03:03.880
that must be just like
a great viewing party.

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:04.713
(Kelly and Craig laughing)

00:03:04.713 --> 00:03:06.840
It's like, who's showing up?

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:07.673
That's amazing.

00:03:07.673 --> 00:03:09.870
So what's the wildest thing
you've ever done for money

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:11.367
