00:03:19.260 --> 00:03:21.000
You know, I guess do
you handle like hecklers

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:21.833
or anything like that well?

00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:23.015
Like especially when you first started.

00:03:23.015 --> 00:03:25.200
- I've had some good moments.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.400
- Yeah?
- [Craig] Against a heckler.

00:03:26.400 --> 00:03:27.233
Yeah.

00:03:27.233 --> 00:03:29.509
