had too much to drink.

00:03:33.630 --> 00:03:35.160
I love playing with those people.

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:35.993
- Right, right.

00:03:35.993 --> 00:03:37.710
And you gotta like, you know,

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.330
kind of feel 'em out, see if they're-

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.163
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- Like with you

00:03:40.163 --> 00:03:40.996
or against you.

00:03:40.996 --> 00:03:41.891
'Cause some peoples are good.
- or an angry drunk,

00:03:41.891 --> 00:03:43.373
- Somebody's just like, I love you!

00:03:43.373 --> 00:03:45.630
Like, I don't think I love you too.

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.940
And some people, yeah,
just- they wanna be part

00:03:47.940 --> 00:03:49.768
of the show and you gotta-
- [Kelly] pipe down.

00:03:49.768 --> 00:03:50.990
- Let 'em know they're not.
- Yeah

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:52.710
(Kelly laughing)
It says Craig Robinson.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:53.543
Is your name Craig?

00:03:53.543 --> 00:03:54.376
It might be Craig Robinson.

00:03:54.376 --> 00:03:55.400
- It might be Craig Robinson.
- [Kelly] You don't know.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.700
(Kelly and Craig laughing)

00:03:56.700 --> 00:03:59.382
I heard that you had to cancel
a standup show last year,

00:03:59.382 --> 00:04:01.350
so what happened?
- Oh, oh, oh, yeah, yeah.

00:04:01.350 --> 00:04:03.063
It was a active shooter.

00:04:05.096 --> 00:04:06.180
It was in North Carolina.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.700
There was an active shooter guy came in

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:12.090
and he came in and he had a gun.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:13.590
And luckily it was between shows,

00:04:13.590 --> 00:04:15.930
so they had just seated like one table.

00:04:15.930 --> 00:04:17.640
And then he came in there.

00:04:17.640 --> 00:04:21.750
He waved at the front of the
staff and some of the patrons,

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.880
anybody who don't want to
get shot you know, get out.

00:04:23.880 --> 00:04:25.457
And then they got us to safety.

00:04:25.457 --> 00:04:26.820
