- That was on one time thing.

00:04:30.773 --> 00:04:33.835
And he actually was coming
to see another show.

00:04:33.835 --> 00:04:36.183
So I don't think I was targeted,

00:04:37.622 --> 00:04:41.167
but like I said, I felt
more than safe being there.

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:42.000
- [Kelly] Okay.
- You know,

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:44.393
it was just the fact that he had arrived.

00:04:44.393 --> 00:04:46.137
- I love that you don't let fear drive you

00:04:46.137 --> 00:04:48.343
or keep you from doing something you love.

00:04:48.343 --> 00:04:49.673
- [Craig] Well, now.
- Yeah.

00:04:49.673 --> 00:04:51.600
But yeah, I'm sure that night it was like,

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:52.990
maybe I should change vocations.

00:04:52.990 --> 00:04:56.490
Okay so I hear you seem to find
a piano wherever you travel.

00:04:56.490 --> 00:04:57.540
Is this a thing you love to do?

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.000
