a piano I didn't like.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:00.963
- I like that.
- [Craig] Yeah.

00:05:00.963 --> 00:05:02.473
- That's 'cause you're good at it.

00:05:02.473 --> 00:05:04.607
- Every once in a while I'll be somewhere

00:05:04.607 --> 00:05:07.170
and there'll be a piano somewhere-

00:05:07.170 --> 00:05:08.003
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:05:08.003 --> 00:05:08.836
- [Craig] And I'll pop up and sit down.

00:05:08.836 --> 00:05:09.720
Yeah. Yeah.
- [Kelly] Especially the bar

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.010
